{"id":363,"title":"曲面图Surface Plot 绘制3D图形","summary":" 在本课中，我们将学习如何使用曲面图绘制三维数据。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6bb90675-81db-4076-a5de-6f7fd4b412fe","text":"在大多数情况下，二维图像是我们关注的焦点，因为两个变量之间的关系通常是我们研究的重点。然而，出现的情况是，我们需要探索两个以上的变量之间的关系，比如函数$z=f(x,y)$。\n\nMatplotlib提供了许多用于绘制3D图的函数。然而，在本课程中，我们将只关注其中一个：`surface`表面图。三维图形本质上是三维空间中的点的图，数据点是$(x,y,z)$。表面图就像一个线框图，但线框的每个面都是一个填充的多边形。我们还可以在曲面图上添加颜色图，这可以帮助人们感知曲面的拓扑结构。\n\n\n绘制曲面的基本函数是`plot_surface()`。下面是它的一些重要参数：\n\n- `X, Y, Z`：二维数组，数据值。\n\n- `rcount, ccount`：每个方向使用的最大样本数。如果输入的数据很大，它将对数据进行降采样(downsample)处理。\n- `cmap`：设置表面补丁(surface patches)的颜色映射。\n- `color`：设置表面补丁的颜色。\n- `norm`：设置色块的规范化。","text_html":"<p>在大多数情况下，二维图像是我们关注的焦点，因为两个变量之间的关系通常是我们研究的重点。然而，出现的情况是，我们需要探索两个以上的变量之间的关系，比如函数<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=f(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>Matplotlib提供了许多用于绘制3D图的函数。然而，在本课程中，我们将只关注其中一个：<code>surface</code>表面图。三维图形本质上是三维空间中的点的图，数据点是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y,z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。表面图就像一个线框图，但线框的每个面都是一个填充的多边形。我们还可以在曲面图上添加颜色图，这可以帮助人们感知曲面的拓扑结构。</p>\n<p>绘制曲面的基本函数是<code>plot_surface()</code>。下面是它的一些重要参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code>X, Y, Z</code>：二维数组，数据值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>rcount, ccount</code>：每个方向使用的最大样本数。如果输入的数据很大，它将对数据进行降采样(downsample)处理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>cmap</code>：设置表面补丁(surface patches)的颜色映射。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>color</code>：设置表面补丁的颜色。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>norm</code>：设置色块的规范化。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"82bd4823-beb0-43c4-9322-79dedee2e5e3","text":"## 绘制一个简单的曲面图\n\n\n\n- 代码第1行：从`mpl_toolkits.mplot3d`中导入`Axes3D`\n\n- 代码第9-10：`meshgird`帮助我们根据我们的x，y空间生成所有$(x,y)$对。简而言之，该函数为$cos(sqrt(x^2 + y^2))$创建了一个笛卡尔集合。\n\n- 代码第13行：根据`projection='3d'`获取`gca`。\n\n- 代码第14行：作图。","text_html":"<h2>绘制一个简单的曲面图</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>代码第1行：从<code>mpl_toolkits.mplot3d</code>中导入<code>Axes3D</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>代码第9-10：<code>meshgird</code>帮助我们根据我们的x，y空间生成所有<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>对。简而言之，该函数为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cos(sqrt(x^2 + y^2))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.064108em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>创建了一个笛卡尔集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>代码第13行：根据<code>projection='3d'</code>获取<code>gca</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>代码第14行：作图。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a33a2733-d147-42ca-8571-070731712eb0","title":"","caption":"曲面图surface plot","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"from mpl_toolkits.mplot3d import Axes3D\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n\nX = np.linspace(-5, 5, 200)\nY = np.linspace(-5, 5, 200)\n\nX, Y = np.meshgrid(X, Y)\nZ = np.cos(np.sqrt(X**2 + Y**2))\n\nfig, axe = plt.subplots(dpi=800)\naxe = fig.gca(projection='3d')\naxe.plot_surface(X, Y, Z)\nfig.savefig(\"output/output.png\")\nplt.close(fig)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"1\n9 10\n13","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4c0fa5e2-5e97-4e5d-96c1-ccd57c6403b9","text":"## 在曲面上添加颜色\n\n为了使图表更加醒目，帮助用户更好地理解图表，我们可以在Z轴的基础上添加一个颜色图。\n\n代码14-15行：根据上一课，通过`get_cmp`获得一个预定义的颜色图谱，并将其传递给`cmp`参数。然后调用`colorbar()`在图形上添加一个颜色条。\n\n```python\nsurf = axe.plot_surface(X, Y, Z, cmap=plt.get_cmap(\"plasma\"))\nplt.colorbar(surf)\n```","text_html":"<h2>在曲面上添加颜色</h2>\n<p>为了使图表更加醒目，帮助用户更好地理解图表，我们可以在Z轴的基础上添加一个颜色图。</p>\n<p>代码14-15行：根据上一课，通过<code>get_cmp</code>获得一个预定义的颜色图谱，并将其传递给<code>cmp</code>参数。然后调用<code>colorbar()</code>在图形上添加一个颜色条。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">surf = axe.plot_surface(X, Y, Z, cmap=plt.get_cmap(&quot;plasma&quot;))\nplt.colorbar(surf)\n</code></pre>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"422bbe9c-e5cd-47fd-b0d3-5f80944fb8bb","title":"","caption":"3D图的颜色","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"from mpl_toolkits.mplot3d import Axes3D\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n\nX = np.linspace(-5, 5, 200)\nY = np.linspace(-5, 5, 200)\n\nX, Y = np.meshgrid(X, Y)\nZ = np.cos(np.sqrt(X**2 + Y**2))\n\nfig, axe = plt.subplots(dpi=800)\naxe = fig.gca(projection='3d')\nsurf = axe.plot_surface(X, Y, Z, cmap=plt.get_cmap(\"plasma\"))\nplt.colorbar(surf)\nfig.savefig(\"output/output.png\")\nplt.close(fig)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"14 15","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4}],"status":"undo","course_no":"008","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/008/page/363"}
